{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/771669-telepathic-totem","id":771669,"title":"Telepathic Totem","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-22T13:07:53-08:00","id":771669,"title":"Telepathic Totem","content":"Hey everyone!<br /> <br /> My players got this for their totem:<br /> [COLOR=rgb(13.700000%, 12.300000%, 12.600000%)]<span style=\"font-family:Goudy\">4 Totem is connected mystically to all pack mem- bers, allowing communication among them even at great distances. </span>[/COLOR]<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> How do you work with this? It's telepathy, pure and simple? Empathic Communication (only feels what they feel)? Something like Sense 8?<br /> <br /> Do you use this, and if so, how?<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5426-aecioborba","name":"aecioborba","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-22T13:28:10-08:00","id":771687,"title":"","content":"Our pack has this and its basicly an all the time (barring special supernatural interferance) conference call.<br /> <br /> Nah, that not the right description...the characters are always able to talk to one another if they want. Comes in real handy if we need to talk quietly amongst ourselves or when our scout found something interesting and doesn't want to alert people to her location.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imageshack.com/i/j5vvlqp\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/j5vvlqp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img ite